    "updated_at": "2026-11-09T22:02:54Z",
    "body": "**Hands-on check passed** (contributor, macOS, this branch's build launched with `--mcp-port 7333`, the M5 session driving it over MCP):\n- The status bar showed \"MCP listening on 127.0.0.1:7333\".\n- `add_tool`, `set_stock` and `add_operation` (\"Agent face\") from the agent appeared live in the running window. \"Agent face  Face  never\" showed under Operations, the tool under Tools, and the 40×40×10 stock in the viewport, with no click from the user. The status line read \"agent: add_operation\".\n- **⌘Z in the window** undid the agent's steps through the same history, back to the empty document.\n\nTogether with the MCP-driven check above (undo/redo round trip, `open_project` refused in a live session), this covers the PR's \"not exercised\" items. The status-line contrast the user noticed is the pre-#524 theme-slot issue in this older build, not this PR's. Ready for review.",
